    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Cite the ACTUAL shipped file paths, method/endpoint signatures, and envelope field names from tasks 013/020/021/022/024 — do not restate the design-time promise from R3's existing alignment note as if it were confirmed fact without verifying it against the shipped code first.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">State explicitly that R3 MUST NOT wire its own communication-arrived producer (spine emits; R3 consumes only) — this is a MUST NOT rule from spec/root CLAUDE.md, not a suggestion.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Deliver the note into R3's own notes directory (the sibling worktree), not only into this project's notes — the deliverable's purpose is R3 acknowledgment at their P1, which requires the note to live where their team looks for it.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
